    "faq_home": {
      "type": "accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where is For Your Eternity based?",
            "content": "<p>We are an independent jeweller based in London. Consultations are by appointment, in person across London or by video, phone and WhatsApp; there is no walk-in showroom. Delivery is free, tracked and insured anywhere in the UK, and we can ship internationally by arrangement before you order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who designs and makes the jewellery?",
            "content": "<p>Every piece is designed with you, guided by our founder Edward Marno, made to order in our London workshop and hallmarked at the London or Birmingham Assay Office. We are a member of the National Association of Jewellers, and For Your Eternity Ltd is registered at Companies House, number 16261484.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are your diamonds certified and ethically sourced?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Every centre diamond, natural or lab-grown, comes with a GIA or IGI certificate shown on the listing; smaller stones are graded and the grade is listed. Natural diamonds are sourced under the Kimberley Process and the World Diamond Council System of Warranties, and our metals are responsibly sourced.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I buy online, or do I need an appointment?",
            "content": "<p>Both work. More than 3,000 rings can be configured and ordered online by metal, size and centre stone, with no appointment needed. Or book a free consultation first: 20 minutes to start, as long as you need after that, and no obligation either way.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does a piece take?",
            "content": "<p>Rings normally take 3 to 4 weeks from the next working day. Bespoke designs take 2 to 5 weeks depending on the design, plus any time needed to source a particular stone. For bracelets we confirm the time when you order. If you have a date, tell us before you order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if the ring does not fit?",
            "content": "<p>We post a free UK ring sizer before you order, and every ring includes one free resize within 12 months of delivery. Full eternity rings are the exception, because they are set all the way round, so we confirm their size with extra care before they are made.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q7": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if something is wrong with my piece?",
            "content": "<p>Every piece carries a lifetime warranty against manufacturing defects. If it arrives faulty or not as ordered, you can reject it for a full refund within 30 days; after that we repair or replace it. Made-to-order and bespoke pieces have no change-of-mind returns; ready-made pieces can be returned within 14 days of delivery, unworn.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
